flowchart TD
  Customer[Customer browser] --> SPA[React SPA]
  SPA --> Proxy[Vercel API and OAuth proxy]
  Proxy --> API[Spring Boot controllers]
  API --> Services[Authentication, catalogue, booking, payment, AI services]
  Services --> DB[(MySQL 8 / Flyway)]
  Services --> Cache[(Redis, optional)]
  Services --> Queue[(RabbitMQ / outbox, optional)]
  Services --> Google[Google OIDC, optional]
  Services --> LLM[LLM provider via Spring AI, optional]
  Services --> Gateway[Razorpay, optional]
  Services --> SMTP[SMTP email, optional]
  DB --> Dash[Database-backed dashboards]
  Dash --> SPA
